{"availability":"available","full":"cwaite3-bit/msp-crm","name":"msp-crm","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-14T20:14:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T19:09:13Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://msp-crm-seven.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://msp-crm-seven.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:16.272Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:16.272Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:16.272Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.855Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:36:58.152Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T00:45:16.272Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight CRM (customers, contacts, activity log) plus a full IT-MSP quoting tool that pushes accepted quotes into QuickBooks Online as invoices. Built to run as its own Vercel project — independent of any other app you host on the same Vercel account — with Postgres (Neon) as the database.","Ticketing/PSA is intentionally out of scope: this app is meant to be the system of record for customers and quotes, with a separate PSA tool (ConnectWise, Halo, Autotask, etc.) pulling customer records from here."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cwaite3-bit/msp-crm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"782b8a83165c892e337d0509dff2e94a08e4ac598a5a43780f169c8a5149ad7d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:25.081Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:25.081Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight CRM (customers, contacts, activity log) plus a full IT-MSP quoting tool that pushes accepted quotes into QuickBooks Online as invoices. Built to run as its own Vercel project — independent of any other app you host on the same Vercel account — with Postgres (Neon) as the database.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cwaite3-bit/msp-crm/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requ